<P2>
<Pnumber>6</Pnumber>
<P2para>
<Text>the relevant percentage to be applied each April is the percentage applied for the purposes of Part I of the Pensions (Increase) Act 1971 in respect of that April</Text>
</P2para>
</P2>
</BlockAmendment>
